    "description": "<b>Fx Racer</b> is a competitive racing game and an evolution of the legendary Formula Unlimited Racing game.\r\n\r\n<b>Main Features</b>\r\nWorld Championship.\r\nQuick Race.\r\n5-race tournaments in various locations.\r\nRace strategy.\r\nTire changes in the pit lane.\r\nCar and team customization.\r\n\r\n<b>Race Options</b>\r\nSelect your strategy for each race. You can choose the type of tire to start each race and during the Pit Stop (Super Soft, Soft, Medium, Hard, Intermediate, and Extreme Rain).\r\nEach tire type has specific characteristics in terms of grip, top speed, and wear. This feature is not available in Formula Unlimited.\r\n\r\n<b>Configure Your Car</b>\r\nFull car setup customization. Adjust engine power, transmission settings, aerodynamics, and suspension settings.\r\nThese adjustments affect vehicle performance, including acceleration, top speed, and tire wear. Experiment with various setups to find the most suitable one for each race.\r\n\r\n<b>Car Upgrades</b>\r\nEarn credits by competing in the championship or quick races to make up to 50 upgrades to each car, enhancing their performance in races. This option follows the same system as in Formula Unlimited Racing.\r\n\r\n<b>Weather Changes During Races</b>\r\nWeather conditions will change during the race, requiring you to adapt your strategy to the circumstances, from sunny weather to heavy rain.\r\n\r\n<b>Qualifying Race</b>\r\nYou can participate in a qualifying race before championship races to establish your place on the starting grid.\r\nAlternatively, you can race without qualifying, in which case your position will be random.\r\n\r\n<b>Practice Race</b>\r\nYou can practice on each championship circuit, testing various car setups.\r\nAfterward, you'll have a results table to compare lap times and setups.\r\n\r\n<b>Quick Race Mode</b>\r\nIn addition to the championship, this mode allows you to race on any chosen circuit and quickly earn credits to use on car upgrades or to purchase new cars.\r\n\r\nFx Racer is the improved evolution of the Formula Unlimited Racing game.\r\n\r\n<b>All updates on the YouTube channel:</b>\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvb_SYcfg5PZ03PRnybEp4Q",
